sequenceDiagram
    actor Doctor as Doctor
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as Notification outbox
    actor Lab as Lab member or contact
    actor Desk as Receptionist
    Doctor->>Web: Submit to lab
    Web->>API: POST /lab-orders/:id/submit with Idempotency-Key
    API->>PG: one transaction - status, order_no, price snapshot, revision 1, magic link
    API->>Outbox: order.submitted and order.magic_link rows
    Outbox-->>Lab: in-app alert for lab members, link message for the lab contact
    Lab->>API: GET /lab-link/:token or portal order
    Lab->>API: POST accept with expected date
    API->>PG: items accepted, order derived to accepted, vendor bill draft, stages created
    API->>Outbox: order.accepted to the doctor
    Lab->>API: POST /lab-portal/production start, finish, QC pass
    API->>Outbox: item.ready to the doctor
    Lab->>API: POST /lab-portal/production/shipments
    API->>PG: shipment SHP-n with QR token, item dispatched
    API->>Outbox: stage.sent_to_clinic to the doctor
    Desk->>Web: Scan the slip QR
    Web->>API: POST /lab-shipments/:id/receive
    API->>PG: lines received, item received, order derived
    API->>Outbox: shipment.received to the lab
    Doctor->>API: approve work, then deliver
    API->>PG: item delivered, warranty starts, order completed when all done
